sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Cashier
    participant UI as CreateOrderPage
    participant CS as cart slice (client state)
    participant PS as product slice
    participant OT as orderThunks createOrder
    participant BE as OrderController
    participant OS as order slice
    C->>UI: search product
    UI->>PS: searchProducts(query, storeId)
    PS->>BE: GET /api/products/store/{storeId}/search?q=
    BE-->>PS: matching products
    C->>CS: addToCart, change quantity
    C->>CS: setSelectedCustomer, setDiscount, setPaymentMethod, setNote
    CS->>CS: subtotal + 18% tax - discount = total
    opt hold order
        C->>CS: holdOrder, later resumeOrder
    end
    C->>OT: pay, dispatch(createOrder(dto))
    OT->>BE: POST /api/orders (Bearer jwt)
    BE-->>OT: OrderDTO
    OT->>OS: fulfilled, selectedOrder = order
    UI->>CS: clearCart / resetOrder
    UI-->>C: show bill and download option
